# Links that the link check of this repository skips, one regular expression per
# line, each with its reason above it. The rules of every repository are in lychee.toml.

# The pictures of the README, which point at main so that the website shows them as
# well: a pull request that adds one links it before main has it. scripts/check-project.sh
# checks that every one of them is in the repository.
^https://github\.com/Dennis-Otto/paperless-unified-search/raw/main/screenshots/
# The pages of the website that the README links: a pull request that adds a page links
# it before the website has it. scripts/check-project.sh checks that each is a page of docs/.
^https://dennis-otto\.github\.io/paperless-unified-search/[a-z0-9-]+\.html
